{65}{Well...let me see... All I really wanted was this nice little cottage to call my own, but the town elders wouldn't allow me to build it. So I made my way to Tulla, where I studied hard and mastered Force and Temporal, as well as Necromanic Black and White. Soon afterwards I was able to gather support from some disgruntled students and masters to form the Necro Black Assassins.}{Well...let me see... All I really wanted was this nice little cottage to call my own, but the town elders wouldn't allow me to build it. So I made my way to Tulla, where I studied hard and mastered Force and Temporal, as well as Necromanic Black and White. Soon afterwards I was able to gather support from some disgruntled students and masters to form the Necro Black Assassins.}{}{}{}{}
{66}{[Cautiously] Assassins..... Go on....}{}{5}{}{75}{}
{68}{Oh... Go on...}{}{-4}{}{75}{}
{75}{Over the next few years, I led them through many adventures, including the Conquering of Cororanth, the Destruction of Azamund Castle, and the slaughter of the Dragonaard Horde. And, as you might imagine, we proceeded to collect a fair amount of attention in the process. }{Over the next few years, I led them through many adventures, including the Conquering of Cororanth, the Destruction of Azamund Castle, and the slaughter of the Dragonaard Horde. And, as you might imagine, we proceeded to collect a fair amount of attention in the process. }{}{}{}{}
{76}{Yes.... I can well imagine.}{}{5}{}{80}{}
{77}{Uhh.. Yeah....}{}{-4}{}{80}{}
{80}{So, to sooth a few of the more nervous mucky-mucks, I allied myself with the Panarrii by agreeing to make it the official religion of the land. With the combined forces of my band and Alexander's Holy Knights, we blitzkrieged this entire area from Caladon to Roseborough.}{So, to sooth a few of the more nervous mucky-mucks, I allied myself with the Panarrii by agreeing to make it the official religion of the land. With the combined forces of my band and Alexander's Holy Knights, we blitzkrieged this entire area from Caladon to Roseborough.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{And then?}{}{5}{}{84}{}
{82}{So...?}{}{-4}{}{84}{}
{84}{Then I made those town elders come out here and build me my damned cottage outside of town so I wouldn't have to answer fool questions from fools like you!!!!}{Then I made those town elders come out here and build me my damned cottage outside of town so I wouldn't have to answer fool questions from fools like you!!!!}{}{}{}{re-30}
